n <MATH_0006> open the restriction map\nis given by the commutativity of the diagram\n<MATH_0007>\nIt is clear that this defines a presheaf of sets. The construction\nis clearly functorial in the presheaf <MATH_0008> and hence\nwe obtain a functor\n<MATH_0009>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:21b5f1ab3f0671d15dde585577506019d1f5edd754184efe7474df7a9c6ad525", "unit_id": "inventory:sheaves:008C:paragraph/0002"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:f779341200156a4c9c17c4c5f8288739bdd7a04b9fcca80680219ef34db7321b", "hash": "sha256:f779341200156a4c9c17c4c5f8288739bdd7a04b9fcca80680219ef34db7321b", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 68062, "byte_start": 67877, "file": "sheaves.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:d11abef95199540f15deb973020d752f5cb3485845fc66f71a2850e5ca61cca2", "line_end": 2027, "line_start": 2023}, "owner_tag": "008D", "parent_tag": "008C", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "sheaves", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "008C", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$V = \\bigcup V_j$", "MATH_0002": "$Y$", "MATH_0003": "$f^{-1}(V) = \\bigcup f^{-1}(V_j)$", "MATH_0004": "$X$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{proof}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{proof}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a687dc33e9a6ffbb57524e4727b6b423664387650258cb6274ca9f926bff08d9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cc7faed5347c634fbec16ce06f097ab9f3234627dd50f2d5352d8c431a73771e", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nThis immediately follows from the fact that\nif <MATH_0001> is an open covering in <MATH_0002>,\nthen <MATH_0003> is an open covering in <MATH_0004>.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:89bfe574a39bfc603b4f223e28ee5c8255fd94005795daf43452b42031af42f0", "unit_id": "inventory:sheaves:008D:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:83d62e822008d8d51fcb0e0f7f39a5d1cb6a